    },
    "findings": [
      "commands end with their shell; children (held output, quiet, setsid, after exit 3) keep running, also after the session ends",
      "TaskStop and timeout kills end the whole tree; children started with setsid outside a stopped command keep running",
      "a background command whose shell exits completes and is notified at once",
      "TaskStop of a finished task: 'No task found with ID: <id>'",
      "native's snapshot option filter (set -o | grep on) keeps 'monitor' and 'onecmd'"
    ]
  },
